  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Search action, you make a Wisdom check to discern something that isn’t obvious. The Search table suggests which skills are applicable when you take this action, depending on what you’re trying to detect.</p><p><strong>Insight</strong> : a creature’s state of mind. <strong>Medicine</strong> : a creature’s ailment. <strong>Perception</strong> : a concealed creature or object. <strong>Survival</strong> : tracks or food.</p><p><em>Macro Helper</em> : choose the skill on the card; the GM sets the DC.</p>",
